CONCEPT OF SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY
A business cannot survive for a long time by pursuing only
economic objectives. Along with economic objectives, it must
have some social objectives.
Social responsibility relates to the voluntary efforts on the
part of businessmen to contribute to the social well-being.
Social responsibility is the obligation of businessmen
towards the society. The business cannot exist in isolation.
The businessmen make use of resources of society and earn
from the members of society so they must do something for
the society.
