THE CASE FOR SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY
Social Power: A business firm has considerable social power and
corresponding responsibility toward the society.There must be a
balance between the power and responsibility. Any imbalance opens
the door to irresponsible behaviour. The power is given to meet
responsibility. If businessmen aveid it, then some of its powers can be
withdrawn by the government and other social groups.
Contribution to Social Problems. Business has created somе
social problems such as pollution, creation of unsafe workplaces,
discrimination, etc. Businessmen must take initiative to solve
social problems because these are created as a result of business
operations.
