CASE STUDY
Inn Trin Itd is a well-known company in telecom sector. The company is committed to treat
everyone fairly with respect and dignity, regardless of difference in age, caste, creed, gender,
etc. It not only abides by all the laws and pays taxes on time, but also makes service and
participates in social service projects. It prefers to give fair advertisement without any
exaggeration, and charge fairly from its customers and maintain quality. Its managers work
effectively and efficiently and minimise waste to maximize the return to their shareholders. The
company is running a charitable hospital to provide medical facility to the people of that area.
In the context of above case,
By quoting the lines from the paragraph, identify different Interest groups towards which
company is fulfilling its social responsibilities.
प्रारंBATCH
Answer:
Employees: "Company is committed to treat everyone fairly with respect
and dignity, regardless of difference in age, caste, creed and gender.
Government: "It not only abides by all the laws and pays taxes on time."
Consumers: "It prefers to give fair advertisement without any
exaggeration, charge fairly from its customers and maintain quality.
Shareholders/Owners: "Its managers work effectively and efficiently and
minimise waste to maximize the return to their shareholders."
Community: "The company is running a charitable hospital to provide
medical facility to the people of that area."
